   "country": "United States / China / EU / Japan / India / Vietnam",
   "text": "[[p:Office of the United States Trade Representative|USTR]] proposed [[e:Section 301 of the Trade Act of 1974|Section 301]] tariffs on 14 economies over 'excess capacity': 15% for the EU, Japan, Korea, Switzerland and Taiwan, 20% for China, 25% for India, 35% for Vietnam. No finding on Mexico or Norway; hearings start 25 Jan, duties January at the earliest.",
